Previous Version/

# Michael's problem files. `HANDOVER.md` §8 has said these are gitignored since
# they existed; they were not, and a single `git add -A` would have published
# them. They are his drawings, they are the best test material in the project,
# and a copy of anything that produces a fix is frozen into `test/fixtures/`
# instead — which is what the tests read.
debug/
*.kate-swp
